    "text": "Douglas County, Oregon\nTwo arrested by DINT as two separate long-term investigations conclude\nBy Lauren Pretto,11 hours ago\nDOUGLAS CO., Ore.- Two people are in jail for methamphetamine charges after the Douglas Interagency Narcotics Team (DINT) concluded two long-term investigations. 64-year-old Sharon Aguilar was arrested Tuesday and 44-year-old Frederick Hanson was arrested on Friday. Both face charges of Unlawful Manufacture, Delivery, and Possession of Methamphetamine, along with other...\n2\nComments\nLoading editor...",
